/*
 * Phellipe - GUI layout and Cairo painting for the voronoi-mosaic UI.
 *
 * Bold flat-color faceted mosaic, no gradients/skeuomorphism: a real bounded
 * Voronoi tessellation (see VoronoiGeometry.hpp, generated by
 * tools/gen_voronoi.py) divides the window into a central artwork cell,
 * several functional module cells (each a knob-row panel, same widget
 * language as paintKnob() below), and unlabeled dark filler facets for
 * texture.
 */

